{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 Unravel the village\u2019s dark secrets, survive terrifying horrors, and escape the curse before it's too late.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/0203_2_1.png?t=1740108428\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/THUMBNAIL.png?t=1740108428\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/0203.png?t=1740108428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 A gripping horror adventure where every shadow hides a secret, and every step brings you closer to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</i></strong> is a first-person horror adventure where players step into the shoes of an investigator sent to inspect strange occurrences in a remote jungle. What starts as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a terrifying nightmare, as the player is ambushed, wakes up in an unknown location, and finds themselves entangled in the dark secrets of an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With eerie messages hinting at a malevolent force and a monster lurking in the shadows, the player must navigate a haunting world filled with supernatural threats, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the village\u2019s curse before it\u2019s too late.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528270?t=1740108428","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528270?t=1740108428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/92c4106b7f7775697fbcd23c0baf